  "details": "It might be better to wait until not just VRC+ users can age-verify, but I figure one of the uses behind age verification could be to make \"Sexually Suggestive Content\" rated avatars not able to be selected/cloned by those who have not Age Verified. I have no idea what's the plan for it currently, but since all it seems to do at the moment is provide a (actually kinda useful) little 'age-verified' tag to your profile, I can't help but get some ideas for what else it can do.",
